  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "EntityInspector is a core Angular component inheriting from ObjectInspector, designed to provide a comprehensive, interactive property inspection panel for a SceneEntity. It dynamically discovers and displays all relevant entity properties, integrating specialized inspectors like TransformInspector and BehaviourInspector. Its primary role is to facilitate runtime modification of entity state, triggering canvas resizing upon data changes and managing behaviour instantiation via ObjectInstanciator."
  },
